# Third-party licences

The `robin` program links the crates below into its binary, and their
licences ask that their notices travel with it. This file is what carries
them.

It says nothing about the game itself. Robin of the Wood belongs to its rights
holders, this project contains no part of it, and the program reads
everything it needs from the player's own copy when it starts. The README
says where to get one.

